{"availability":"available","full":"evgxnx/polar-hrv-viz","name":"polar-hrv-viz","description":"Visualise heart rate, RR intervals and motion from Polar optical sensors, split by experiment phases","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T21:21:56Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:04:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://evgxnx.github.io/polar-hrv-viz/","topics":["heart-rate-variability","polar","psychophysiology","python","visualization"],"demo":"https://evgxnx.github.io/polar-hrv-viz/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:10.932Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:10.932Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:10.932Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:10.932Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Visualise heart rate, RR intervals and motion recorded with a Polar optical sensor (Verity Sense, OH1), split by the phases of an experiment.","The package was written for research on multimodal emotional AI for assessing the professional preparation of educators. One of the modalities in that work is cardiac activity measured during an assessment session: rest, a task, recovery and so on. Before any model looks at this signal, a researcher needs to see it, to check its quality and to compare the phases. This tool does exactly that and nothing more."],"features":["Loads a recording from plain CSV files and validates it: missing files and columns, broken rows, overlapping phases.","Flags RR artifacts: physiologically impossible intervals, outliers against the local median, and beats the sensor itself marked as unreliable.","Summarises every phase: mean heart rate, mean RR, RMSSD and the share of artifacts.","Renders four figures in a light, print-friendly style:","Builds a self-contained HTML report: overview tiles, the phase summary table, all figures and a short method note in one file that opens in any browser and prints cleanly."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evgxnx/polar-hrv-viz/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"31d86aa431361504d35365a46cf3ed47e1263c88f797a30ce2acc226d95d56c0","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.034Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.034Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Visualise heart rate, RR intervals and motion recorded with a Polar optical sensor (Verity Sense, OH1), split by the phases of an experiment.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evgxnx/polar-hrv-viz/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"31d86aa431361504d35365a46cf3ed47e1263c88f797a30ce2acc226d95d56c0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evgxnx/polar-hrv-viz/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.034Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T22:04:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evgxnx/polar-hrv-viz/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.035Z","hash":"31d86aa431361504d35365a46cf3ed47e1263c88f797a30ce2acc226d95d56c0","originalBytes":11423,"storedBytes":11423,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["synthetic","one","phase","heart","rate","recording","beats","github","sensor","clean","every","figures","intervals","out","python","report","rmssd","artifacts","data","file","html","mean","polar","polar-hrv-viz","run","bash","beat","hrv","marked","phases","plot","variability","any","builds","check","command","csv","format","gallery","interval","poincar","push","ruff","sd1","start","task","tests","tool","wheel","blocker","bpm","columns","does","during","embedded","environment","files","flagged","git","license","motion","n+1","optical","page","per","prints","pytest","recordings","release","rest","rows","sd2","single","style","tag","workflows","against","al.","around","artifact","artifacts.","backend","between","brennan","built","ci.yml","citation.cff","cite","consecutive","coverage","descriptors","differences","directory","end","engineering","features","figure","force","four","genera